{"id":732,"date":"2023-01-03T10:16:07","date_gmt":"2023-01-03T10:16:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/?page_id=732"},"modified":"2025-03-16T23:10:17","modified_gmt":"2025-03-16T23:10:17","slug":"car-accident-lawyers","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/personal-injury\/car-accident-lawyers\/","title":{"rendered":"San Francisco Car Accident Lawyer | Experienced Auto Accident Attorneys"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"pl-732\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-732-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-732-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-732-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"0\" ><div class=\"make-h2-bigger panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-732-0-0-0\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><p><script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/embed\/medias\/gadw8m3bgo.jsonp\" async><\/script><br \/>\n<script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/assets\/external\/E-v1.js\" async><\/script><\/p>\n<div class=\"wistia-container\" style=\"position: relative; padding-top: 56.25%; width: 100%; max-width: 800px; margin: auto;\">\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_wrapper\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n        <span class=\"wistia_embed wistia_async_gadw8m3bgo popover=true videoFoam=true\" \n              style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" \n              aria-label=\"Video: Learn more about how Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm can help with car accident claims in San Francisco.\"><br \/>\n        <\/span>\n    <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-732-0-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"1\" ><div class=\"make-h2-bigger panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-732-0-0-1\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 900;\">Bay Area &amp; San Francisco Car Accident Lawyer<\/h2>\n<h3>Experienced Car Accident Attorneys in California with Proven Success<\/h3>\n<p>If you\u2019ve been injured in a crash, our experienced <strong data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1777\">Car Accident Lawyer San Francisco<\/strong> team is here to help you secure the compensation you deserve.\u00a0 Driving in California presents numerous challenges, from congested highways to unpredictable city streets. With <strong>94% of car accidents caused by human error<\/strong>, collisions are an unfortunate reality. If you\u2019ve been involved in a car accident, you need experienced legal representation to secure the compensation you deserve.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm<\/strong> is a trusted advocate for accident victims across California. With decades of experience and a track record of record-breaking verdicts, our firm has helped clients recover compensation for injuries such as:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Burns<\/li>\n<li>Broken bones<\/li>\n<li>Brain injuries<\/li>\n<li>Spinal cord injuries<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether your accident was a <strong>rear-end collision on the freeway<\/strong> or a <strong>lane-splitting motorcycle crash<\/strong>, our team has the expertise to navigate the legal process and fight for maximum compensation.\u00a0 If your accident occurred while on the job, you may also be eligible for workers\u2019 compensation. <a href=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/workers-compensation\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"943\">Learn more here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Call us today at <strong>(510) 257-4141<\/strong> for a free case consultation.<\/p>\n<h3>Legal Steps After a Car Accident in San Francisco<\/h3>\n<p>Car accidents can lead to complex legal battles, medical expenses, and disputes with insurance companies. At <strong>Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law<\/strong>, we handle all types of accident claims, including:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Road rage incidents<\/li>\n<li>Rear-end collisions<\/li>\n<li>Whiplash injuries<\/li>\n<li>Catastrophic injuries<\/li>\n<li>Wrongful death claims<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Before speaking with an insurance claims adjuster, it\u2019s crucial to consult with a <strong>California car accident lawyer<\/strong> to protect your rights. We can help you secure compensation for:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Medical bills (hospitalization, surgeries, rehabilitation)<\/li>\n<li>Ambulance and emergency care costs<\/li>\n<li>Disability accommodations<\/li>\n<li>Lost wages and future earning potential<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>California law allows <strong>two years from the accident date<\/strong> to file a personal injury claim. The sooner you act, the better your chances of a successful recovery.<\/p>\n<h3>Step-by-Step Guide for Handling a Car Accident in California<\/h3>\n<p>After a car accident, follow these steps to safeguard your rights and strengthen your claim:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Stay at the scene.<\/strong> Leaving can result in legal consequences.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Call the police.<\/strong> A police report provides crucial evidence.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Check for injuries.<\/strong> Seek medical attention immediately.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Exchange information.<\/strong> Collect contact and insurance details.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Take photos.<\/strong> Document vehicle damage, injuries, and the accident scene.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Gather witness statements.<\/strong> Their accounts can strengthen your case.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Report the accident to your insurer.<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Do not admit fault.<\/strong> Let the investigation determine liability.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Consult a car accident lawyer.<\/strong> Legal guidance is essential.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Save our number.<\/strong> Keep <strong>(510) 257-4141<\/strong> on hand for emergencies.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3>What Information Should I Gather from the Accident Scene?<\/h3>\n<p>After an accident, collect the following details:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vehicle make, model, and license plate numbers<\/li>\n<li>Driver\u2019s name, insurance, and registration details<\/li>\n<li>Witness names and contact information<\/li>\n<li>Police officer\u2019s name, badge number, and report details<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Contact <strong>Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law<\/strong> immediately for a free case evaluation.\u00a0 For more information on what to do after an accident, visit the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.dmv.ca.gov\/portal\/vehicle-industry-services\/crash-prevention\/report-a-crash\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"597\">California DMV\u2019s accident reporting page<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Fatal Car Accidents &amp; Wrongful Death Claims<\/h3>\n<p>Tragically, some car accidents result in fatalities. In such cases, surviving family members may be entitled to compensation for:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Funeral and burial expenses<\/li>\n<li>Loss of income and financial support<\/li>\n<li>Medical expenses related to the fatal accident<\/li>\n<li>Emotional distress and loss of companionship<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law<\/strong> specializes in wrongful death claims, ensuring families receive the justice they deserve. We handle these cases on a <strong>contingency basis<\/strong>\u2014meaning you pay nothing unless we win.<\/p>\n<h3>Do You Need to Hire a Car Accident Lawyer?<\/h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"207\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-733 alignleft lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/car-accident-image-300x207.png\" alt=\"Experienced car accident lawyers in San Francisco\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/car-accident-image-300x207.png 300w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/car-accident-image-768x529.png 768w, https:\/\/francomunos.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/car-accident-image.png 829w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 300px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 300\/207;\" \/><\/p>\n<p>If you were injured in a car accident, consulting a lawyer is highly recommended. Even minor accidents can lead to serious complications. Our attorneys can help if your accident involved:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Emergency medical treatment<\/li>\n<li>Hospitalization or long-term care<\/li>\n<li>Disputes over liability<\/li>\n<li>Insurance company delays or denials<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3><strong>Why choose Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Proven track record:<\/strong> Millions recovered for accident victims.<\/li>\n<li><strong>No upfront fees:<\/strong> You only pay if we win your case.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Top-rated attorneys:<\/strong> Recognized as leading car accident lawyers in the Bay Area.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Insurance companies will try to minimize your claim\u2014don\u2019t face them alone. Contact us today for a free consultation.<\/p>\n<h3>What Are the Costs of Hiring a Car Accident Lawyer?<\/h3>\n<p>We work on a <strong>contingency fee basis<\/strong>, meaning:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>No upfront costs<\/li>\n<li>No out-of-pocket fees<\/li>\n<li>We only get paid when you win<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>There is no risk in seeking legal representation. Call us at <strong>(510) 257-4141<\/strong> to learn how we can help.<\/p>\n<h3>Time Limit for Filing a Car Accident Claim in California<\/h3>\n<p>Under <strong>California law<\/strong>, you have:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Two years<\/strong> from the accident date to file a personal injury claim.<\/li>\n<li><strong>180 days<\/strong> to file against a government entity (e.g., city bus accident).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Waiting too long can jeopardize your claim. The sooner you act, the stronger your case will be.<\/p>\n<p>If you need a trusted and experienced <strong data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2322\">Car Accident Lawyer San Francisco<\/strong>, don\u2019t wait to contact Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm for a free consultation. at (510) 257-4141.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-732-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-732-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"2\" ><div class=\"form-sec panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-732-0-1-0\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h2>Contact Us Now<\/h2><p>For A Free Case Evaluation<\/p><small>Please enter a valid email address<\/small><div class=\"wpforms-container wpforms-container-full\" id=\"wpforms-28\"><form id=\"wpforms-form-28\" class=\"wpforms-validate wpforms-form\" data-formid=\"28\" method=\"post\" enctype=\"multipart\/form-data\" action=\"\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/732\" data-token=\"56ef3efad4cece98a44e621745a766bd\" data-token-time=\"1785363156\"><noscript class=\"wpforms-error-noscript\">Please enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.<\/noscript><div class=\"wpforms-field-container\"><div id=\"wpforms-28-field_3-container\" class=\"wpforms-field wpforms-field-text\" data-field-type=\"text\" data-field-id=\"3\"><label class=\"wpforms-field-label wpforms-label-hide\" for=\"wpforms-28-field_3\">Name <span class=\"wpforms-required-label\">*<\/span><\/label><input type=\"text\" id=\"wpforms-28-field_3\" class=\"wpforms-field-large wpforms-field-required\" name=\"wpforms[fields][3]\" placeholder=\"Name*\" required><\/div><div id=\"wpforms-28-field_1-container\" class=\"wpforms-field wpforms-field-email\" data-field-type=\"email\" data-field-id=\"1\"><label class=\"wpforms-field-label wpforms-label-hide\" for=\"wpforms-28-field_1\">Email <span class=\"wpforms-required-label\">*<\/span><\/label><input type=\"email\" id=\"wpforms-28-field_1\" class=\"wpforms-field-large wpforms-field-required\" name=\"wpforms[fields][1]\" placeholder=\"Email*\" spellcheck=\"false\" required><\/div><div id=\"wpforms-28-field_4-conta